<title>HONG KONG: Gyongnam Merchant to set $25 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Gyongnam Merchant to set $25 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gyongnam Merchant Banking Corp has mandated KDB Asia to arrange a US$25 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with no put and call options.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced at par to float at 65 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 80 basis points.</p>
<p>General syndication is scheduled to start next week.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
